; terrain textures (docs/ART.md 5.1-5.2): seamless 64x64, sampled in map space through the domain warp.
; Low-chroma bases near L* 15-35, mottling in the darker partner, sparse signature marks. Hell terrains are
; their twin's texture (same marks, same places) recoloured, plus their own marks (cracks, glints).
; Each texture uses at most 5 colours.

